### Topic 37 - Student API on H2 with JdbcTemplate / NamedParameterJdbcTemplate / JdbcClient
### Watch the console: every SQL statement is logged (DEBUG level).

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/students

### 1. All students (SELECT ... ORDER BY id)
GET {{base}}

### 2. Filter by course (WHERE LOWER(course) = LOWER(?))
GET {{base}}?course=java

### 3. One student (queryForObject / optional)
GET {{base}}/3

### 4. Missing student -> 404 ProblemDetail
GET {{base}}/999

### 5. Create -> INSERT + KeyHolder returns the generated id -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kiran Kumar", "email": "kiran@college.edu", "course": "Java", "marks": 88, "enrolledOn": "2026-07-01" }

### 6. Same email again -> UNIQUE constraint -> DuplicateKeyException -> 409
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kiran Again", "email": "kiran@college.edu", "course": "SQL", "marks": 50, "enrolledOn": "2026-07-02" }

### 7. Invalid input -> 400 (validation, topic 34)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "bad", "course": "Java", "marks": 150, "enrolledOn": "2099-01-01" }

### 8. Update student 6 -> UPDATE ... WHERE id = ?
PUT {{base}}/6
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kiran K", "email": "kiran@college.edu", "course": "Spring", "marks": 91, "enrolledOn": "2026-07-01" }

### 9. GROUP BY statistics
GET {{base}}/stats

### 10. Delete -> 204, then 404
DELETE {{base}}/6
